===Etymology===
From {{etyl|tr}} {{term|yaşmak|lang=tr}}.<ref>[http://www.merriam-webster.com/dictionary/yashmak "yashmak."] ''Merriam-Webster Online Dictionary.'' Merriam-Webster. 2008.</ref>

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# A [[veil]] worn by [[Muslim]] women to cover parts of the face when they are in public.

